  "answer": "Yes. Requests to add translation to PowerToys have been reported before. The ticket you filed reads as if it was written for a chat or social platform. PowerToys has no messages, posts or other users to translate. The nearest match is a request to translate selected or visible text without leaving the current app. PowerToys#18014 is the main tracking issue for that request, and several similar requests were closed as duplicates of it. A separate request, PowerToys#9095, asks for a translation plugin for PowerToys Run. No translation feature has shipped yet, so please add your vote or comment to #18014 instead of opening a new issue. In the meantime, you can use a third-party PowerToys Run translator plugin. Two were linked in #9095: [user]'s PowerToysRun.Plugin.Translater and [user]'s DeepLTranslatorPowerToys. The first needs an internet connection. You can also use a standalone tool such as DeepL."
 },
